+/* Edge buttons: centered bubbles would spill past the panel's side edges
+   (.scenarioPanel{overflow:hidden} clips them). #scSave is leftmost, so its
+   bubble aligns left (shifts right into the panel); #scDelete is rightmost,
+   so its bubble aligns right (shifts left). Vertical placement inherited. */
